# src/packages/lumicore/src/diagnostics

## Purpose
Native network diagnostic routines.

## Contents
- Direct files (15): `censorship_anomaly_prober.rs`, `dynamic_proxy_validator.rs`, `edge_gateway_health.rs`, `flow_analyzer_engine.rs`, `html_report.rs`, `link_encoder.rs`, `mod.rs`, `node_diversity_sampler.rs`, `provider_failover_watcher.rs`, `runbook.rs`, `stun_leak_detector.rs`, `subscription_health_classifier.rs` …

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Rust module membership is controlled by `mod.rs`/`lib.rs`; Cargo is compile authority.
- Host-facing changes must preserve the versioned FFI envelope and private Go ABI declaration checks.

## Invariants
- Do not advertise or promote dormant native surfaces without the Cargo/ABI/CGO verification gate.

## Navigation
- Read this file first, then direct child `.context` files before editing a deeper folder.
